OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786830495
OL,3,CBody found in search for 18-year-old
OL,4,CBritish hiker who went missing in
OL,5,CRomania
OL,7,FA body has been found in the search
OL,8,Ffor an 18-year-old British man who
OL,9,Fwent missing while hiking in Romania,
OL,10,Fpolice said.
OL,12,FGeorge Smyth, a geology student from
OL,13,FBristol, went missing in November last
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FOn Saturday, Avon and Somerset Police
OL,17,Fsaid a body found in the Bucegi
OL,18,FMountain region of the country is
OL,19,Fbelieved to be that ofSmyth.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
