PN,34102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786830495
OL,3,CBody found in search for 18-year-old
OL,4,CBritish hiker who went missing in
OL,5,CRomania
OL,7,FHis family have been informed and are
OL,8,Fbeing supported by a family liaison
OL,9,Fofficer, the force added.
OL,11,FIn a statement released via the force,
OL,12,FSmyth's family said: "We are all
OL,13,Fdevastated by George's death.
OL,15,F"He was the best of us and is deeply
OL,16,Fmissed by his younger brothers, family
OL,17,Fand friends.
OL,26,@tD@VOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786830495
OL,3,CBody found in search for 18-year-old
OL,4,CBritish hiker who went missing in
OL,5,CRomania
OL,7,F"We want to thank Salvamont Mountain
OL,8,FRescue, who have worked tirelessly
OL,9,Fsince November searching for George,
OL,10,Fdespite very difficult and often
OL,11,Fdangerous conditions.
OL,13,F"They are an amazing team, and have
OL,14,Fremained in constant communication,
OL,15,Fhelping us greatly throughout this
OL,16,Fawful time.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
