OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786830495
OL,3,CBody found in search for 18-year-old
OL,4,CBritish hiker who went missing in
OL,5,CRomania
OL,7,F"We would also like to thank Avon and
OL,8,FSomerset Police and University of
OL,9,FBristol, who have gone above and
OL,10,Fbeyond to try and find George, and to
OL,11,Fsupport us as a family.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@oD@AOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
