OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1786830495
OL,3,CBody found in search for 18-year-old
OL,4,CBritish hiker who went missing in
OL,5,CRomania
OL,7,F"Although this latest news is
OL,8,Fincredibly painful, the torture of
OL,9,Fwaiting is finally over, so we can now
OL,10,Ffocus on bringing George home and
OL,11,Fsaying goodbye.
OL,13,F"We would appreciate privacy while we
OL,14,Fcontinue to come to terms with this
OL,15,Floss."
OL,17,FEfforts will be made to return Smyth's
OL,18,Fbody to Bristol once formal
OL,19,Fidentification has taken place.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUwD@FO]
