OL,3,CBody found in search for 18-year-old
OL,4,CBritish hiker who went missing in
OL,5,CRomania
OL,7,FNumerous search efforts for Smyth were
OL,8,Fcalled off in the days and weeks after
OL,9,Fhis disappearance due to the difficult
OL,10,Fterrain and heavy snow at the time.
